Each remains under its own licence, which continues to govern it regardless of
this project's terms. Where a dependency's licence requires its notice to
travel with a distribution, that obligation survives here.

React and React DOM (MIT) are the only runtime dependencies of the browser
app. The MCP server depends on `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk` (MIT) and `zod`
